{"Title":"An Act relative to license plate year of manufacture registration","BillNumber":"H3339","DocketNumber":"HD1903","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"SSH1","Name":"Steven S. Howitt","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SSH1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T17:48:07.68"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"SSH1","Name":"Steven S. Howitt","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SSH1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T17:48:07.68"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3339/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Howitt of Seekonk, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3339) of Steven S. Howitt relative to license plate year of manufacture registration plates when used on antique automobiles.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding any general or special law or regulation to the contrary, Section 6 of Chapter 90 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 official edition, shall be amended by inserting after the word “section” in line 42 the following:-\r\n\t \"However, the restoration of year of manufacture registration plates, painted and restored to their original year of manufacture colors and design, will not be considered altering such registration plates when used on antique automobiles.\"\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}